==Description==
The '''Cowboy''' is an advanced ground [[Towers|tower]] which generates income every few shots. It can be purchased from the store for {{Coins|4,000}} only after triumphing [[Badlands II]]. Due to a bug, the tower does not need to be purchased, instead appearing in the [[Gift Box]]. Alternatively, its [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] can be purchased for {{Robux|3
